graph TD
    Start([Start: Define Task Goal]) --> analyze{Analyze Task<br/>Complexity}
    
    analyze -->|Simple/Clear| zero[Zero-Shot Prompting<br/>'Translate to French: ...']
    analyze -->|Needs Examples| few[Few-Shot Prompting<br/>Show 2-5 examples]
    analyze -->|Complex Reasoning| cot[Chain-of-Thought<br/>'Let's think step by step']
    
    zero --> test1{Test Output<br/>Quality}
    few --> test1
    cot --> test1
    
    test1 -->|Good| finalize[Finalize Prompt Template]
    test1 -->|Poor| refine{Refine Strategy}
    
    refine -->|Add Examples| few
    refine -->|Add Reasoning| cot
    refine -->|Change Wording| rewrite[Rewrite Instructions<br/>More Specific]
    
    rewrite --> test1
    
    finalize --> format[Add Output Formatting<br/>JSON/Bullets/etc]
    format --> constraints[Add Constraints<br/>Length/Tone/Style]
    constraints --> validate[Validate on Test Set]
    
    validate --> eval{Meets<br/>Requirements?}
    eval -->|Yes| deploy[Deploy to Production]
    eval -->|No| debug{Debug Issue}
    
    debug -->|Inconsistent| temp[Adjust Temperature<br/>Lower = More Deterministic]
    debug -->|Wrong Format| format
    debug -->|Hallucinations| rag[Add RAG System<br/>Ground with Facts]
    debug -->|Off-Topic| constraints
    
    temp --> validate
    rag --> validate
    
    deploy --> monitor[Monitor Performance]
    monitor --> feedback{User Feedback}
    feedback -->|Issues Found| refine
    feedback -->|All Good| End([Maintain & Update])
    
    style Start fill:#e1f5ff
    style zero fill:#fff3cd
    style few fill:#ffe1f5
    style cot fill:#ffd4e5
    style deploy fill:#d4edda
    style End fill:#d4edda
